      <title>La’amour collection is a timeless Valentine’s Day tribute to romance and craftsmanship</title>
      <link>https://www.indulgexpress.com/fashion/new-launches/2026/Feb/14/laamour-collection-is-a-timeless-valentines-day-tribute-to-romance-and-craftsmanship</link>
      <description>Da Milano's La’amour collection, part of the Spring–Summer 2026 Resort Collection, offers a timeless tribute to romance and craftsmanship. Featuring eight refined handbags, the collection integrates a subtle heart motif into structured silhouettes, combining full-grain leather with soft suede. The versatile designs, available in passionate red, blush pink, ivory, and black, are crafted to transcend Valentine's Day, offering luxury and practicality.</description>
