      <description>Kushals' new Valentine’s Day jewellery collection beautifully encapsulates the essence of modern love, self-expression, and individuality. Tailored for the contemporary Indian woman, the collection offers three distinct moods: a bold night out, a romantic date night, and a casual coffee date. Each piece is designed to be expressive yet wearable, allowing women to style jewellery that mirrors their personality and mood.</description>
